<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was quiet in Kansas on Thursday and Friday, USDA said. Not enough slaughter steer or heifer sales confirmed for a market test.</p>
<p>Inquiry moderate, demand light. Sales confirmed for the week on 71000 head including 24800 head or about 35 percent previously contracted or formulated cattle.</p>
<p>Confirmed:	 100 last week:  12000  last year:  32000</p>
<p>week to date:  71000 last week:  70500  last year:  85800</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720</p>
